                "text": "As Montana\u2019s insurance commissioner, it was clear that the ACA\u2019s biggest problem is ADVERSE SELECTION \ud83d\udc47\n\nPrices get higher, healthy people leave, sick people stay, the risk pool gets riskier, the pool costs more money, next year, your premiums skyrocket. Wash. Rinse. Repeat. https://t.co/jLy3BZkg1w",
